    "E kindeno gibiro luongo Jerusalem ni Kom Loch mar Jehova Nyasaye, kendo ogendini duto nochokre ei Jerusalem mondo omi nying Jehova Nyasaye duong’. Ok ginichak gitim tim wich teko, bende ok ginibed gi chuny mar timo richo.",
